# READ-FIELD-CLOSURE (Codex K03-READ-FIELD-CLOSURE-20261008-31, -29 step 3): a cycle of calls.  Model's code calls
# f, f calls g and g calls f: the homes close to a fixed point -- f and g, each copied with its occurrence -- and
# f's read of y is held, z is not.  Exit 7.
int: y 3
int: z 9
fn: f (int: n) int
    if: n <= 0
        return: y
    return: g(n - 1)
end: f
fn: g (int: n) int
    return: f(n - 1)
end: g
Model:
    int: k 0
    k: f(4)
end: Model
b: merge: Model
b
int: ok 7
if: b\k != 3
    ok: 81
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
